      "text": "Fit and computation provisionally accepted. Convergence is now judged\nand gates causal effects, but no acceptance is recorded, and causal\ncertification still ignores predictive checks and LOO.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Fit and computation provisionally accepted. Convergence is now judged\nand gates causal effects, but no acceptance is recorded, and causal\ncertification still ignores predictive checks and LOO.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.2
    },
